      {
        "location": "AC socket listing",
        "evidence": "Native AC prints 3308C1 at B-A2J5. The AS061 A1 page key omits this portion; AS051 records the exact same 02B-A2 J5 3308C1 in A1212-01. This corroborates the physical portion only."
      },
      {
        "location": "AH outputs",
        "evidence": "Two printed AH outputs D02 star and K B13 physically join into the positive SUM06 rail. No external driver invented. Native top bit-function pins and all four lower control rails reviewed in enlarged crops."
