      {
        "location": "lower control source audit",
        "evidence": "Enlarged full-width control strip plus native bank crop resolves positive decimal correct to AJ D02; negative decimal correct to AK B07; positive SUM06 to AJ D04 and AK B09. Adjacent rails occupy c131 decimal-positive, c132 BH output, c133 BF product-quotient, c134 decimal-negative, c135 AB feedback, c136 P3, c137 SUM06. Distinct aligned disconnected segments preserved."
