      {
        "location": "final native feedback topology",
        "evidence": "Full native lower view resolves AB D06 feedback: its loop returns through a separate rail at c176, rises to r62, turns left to c135, descends to AM B12 at r91, and branches to BK B05 at r82. AE negative latch rail ends at AB B10 and does not own BK B05. Positive latched-sum output leaves AB on its native pin row."
      },
      {
